/*
:name: readmem_bad_descriptor
:type: error
:error: std.readmemh/readmemb requires one nonempty comptime string filename
*/
// `__readmemh` is the compiler-internal form of `std.readmemh` (prp2lnast
// appends a `@readmemh:1:<dir>` source-dir descriptor), but the bare `__` cell
// call is reachable from source. A second argument that is not a valid
// descriptor is a diagnostic -- it used to trip `I(source.has_value())` in
// upass.constprop (and dereference an empty optional in an opt build).
const x = __readmemh("a.hex", "zzz")
